A GnuPG key pair for the tests, with no passphrase and no expiry.  It is
here so that test/pdf-view-test.el can encrypt test.pdf and open the result,
which is the only way to exercise the epa path without a pinentry.

    pdf-tools test key (no passphrase, for tests only)
    <pdf-tools-test@example.invalid>
    ed25519/BAB0869C7E18F8F7

It protects nothing and is known to everyone who can read this repository.
Do not use it for anything.  The tests import it into a temporary GNUPGHOME
and throw that away again.
